  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a donabe over medium heat and lightly oil the surface.",
    "Sauté tofu cubes until golden, then set aside.",
    "In the same donabe, stir-fry garlic, chili flakes, and lime juice for 1 minute.",
    "Add drained black beans and stir to coat with the aromatics, cooking for 3 minutes.",
    "Return tofu to the pot and mix in low sodium soy sauce and fish sauce, cooking another 2 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, toast rice crackers lightly in a dry pan until crisp.",
    "Divide bean and tofu mixture into bowls, top with toasted rice crackers, carrot, cucumber, bean sprouts, shredded cabbage, and cilantro.",
    "Squeeze fresh lime over the bowls and serve immediately."
